LANGUAGE English

BOOK Gallery
	PAGE ExploreGallery
		TRIGGERED BY @ExploreGallery
		
		PROLOG """
			A door leads farther into the house. Strangely, the latch on the
			door is clean and shiny, like it has been used recently.
		"""

		TEXT """
			The {c:TileGallery} was once stately but now seems shabby.
			Paintings adorn	the walls and all of them are covered in cobwebs
			and dust. Place	the {c:TileGallery} tile as indicated, then remove
			all Explore	tokens leading to this room.
		"""
		
		REMOVE TokenExploreGalleryViaHall1 AFTER
		REMOVE TokenExploreGalleryViaFoyer AFTER
	END ExploreGallery
		
	PAGE PlaceGalleryExploreFoyer
		IF exploredGalleryViaHall1 AND NOT exploredFoyer THEN PAGE IS VISIBLE
		
		TEXT """
			Across the room, a door leads farther into the house. Place an
			Explore token as indicated.
		"""
		
		ADD TokenExploreFoyerViaGallery
	END PlaceExploreFoyerViaGallery
	
	PAGE PlaceGalleryCoatRoom
		TEXT """
			A coat room sits in the corner across from you. Place an Explore
			token as indicated.
		"""
		
		ADD TokenExploreCoatRoom
	END PlaceCoatCloset
		
	PAGE PlaceGalleryDVM
		TEXT """
			The two divans are upholstered with once-beautiful cloth... but now
			they are dirty and moth-eaten. A pile of junk sits on a small table
			between them. Place a Search token as indicated.
		"""
		
		ADD TokenSearchGalleryDVM
		TRIGGER @MoveAfterExplore
		EXIT
	END PAGE




END Gallery